# RepRival — Intelligent Training Analytics, UX Refinement, One-Off Workouts & Holiday Mode

## Overall Objective

RepRival's core workout logging, progressive overload, equipment inventory, session recovery and exercise management are now functioning.

The next development phase should make the application more intelligent, flexible and pleasant to use.

Implement four major improvements:

1. Accurate, understandable Strength Trend and Muscle Heat Zone calculations.
2. A comprehensive application-wide readability, usability and workout-flow refinement.
3. A flexible one-off workout generator based on available equipment, duration, goals and environment.
4. A temporary Holiday Mode with optional equipment-free training plans that preserve the athlete's existing programme.

Expand the exercise catalogue to support a wide variety of genuine no-equipment, floor-based and calisthenics movements.

**Work within the existing application. Preserve all athlete profiles, workout history, progressive overload records, league functionality, exercise customisations and active training programmes.**

Do not rebuild the app or replace established functionality with mock-ups.

